To remediate this, ensure that the input `param` is strictly validated to prevent path traversal characters (e.g., `../`, absolute paths) or, more robustly, ensure that the canonical path of the constructed `fileTarget` resolves within an allowed base directory.

Example of a robust fix:

```java
